	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ago tibi gratias, quas debeo, maximas ob lucubrationes tuas in Acta<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>, Commentarius in Acta apostolorum, 1533 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 43).</note>, tum ob <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>librum contra catabaptistas<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>, Von dem unverschämten Frevel der Wiedertäufer, 1531 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 28).</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Placent enim, ut quod maxime spirant id, quod sunt, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>divinam doctrinam, unde quicunque volunt tranquillas habere conscientias, haurire possunt <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>feliciter, quod satisfaciat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Opto tempus dari, quo vices debitas reddere valeam.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Annotationes in Io[annem]<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Es handelt sich um <persName ref="p2442">Oekolampads</persName> Kommentar zum Johannesevangelium, der von <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> im Juni 1533 herausgegeben wurde, ausführlicher s. oben <ref target="file10288">[Nr. 257]</ref> S. 181, Anm. 5.</note>, quas accepisti, non tibi paraveram - nam hactenus usus sum -, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sed novas, nondum complicatas.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Has dum puero<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Unbekannt.</note> commiseram<pb type="edition" next="186"/> abiens in consistorium, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>accepit alteras imprudens.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Haec excusanda, ne putes in reddendendis [!] <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>beneficiis, si redditio dici potest, me negligentem esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Caeterum audio, quod iterum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nescio quo fiat consilio, <placeName ref="l2448">Pagos</placeName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Die <placeName ref="l2448">V Orte</placeName>.</note> istos nescio quid machinari cum papa, im<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>peratore, <persName ref="p17915">duce Mediolanensi</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p17915">Francesco II. Sforza</persName>, Herzog von <placeName ref="l306">Mailand</placeName>.</note> et nescio quo alio duce<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Siehe <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1c 134f. 140f. 152f; vgl. oben S. 37, Anm. 5.</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Haec si vera comperirem, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>est, quod acturus essem.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Si quid nosti, fac intelligam.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Praeterea habet satan <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ubique suos ministros, qui mala iactant semina in agrum dei<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 13, 25</ref></cit>.</note>, id quod tu quoque nu<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>per indicasti<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. oben S. 167, 12f und 181, 5-7.</note>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Spero tamen futurum aliquando, ut filii dei liberentur, ne quid mali <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cogantur ab impiis pati.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quodsi visum aliter fuerit deo, certum est animabus ni<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>hil impensurum incommodi.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Orandus deus, ut largiatur nobis ex corde et ductu <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>spiritus eius dicamus: «Fiat voluntas tua!» <cit type="bible"><ref>[Mt 6, 10]</ref></cit>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, et gratia tibi data utere.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p3242">Utingerum</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, omnes opto salvos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, 19. septembris anno <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>1533.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myconius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>doctissimo piissimoque verbi di<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>vini praesidi primario <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fratri et domino suo obser<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>vando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
